# @GAME_TITLE@

Game generated with miniGameEngine (`@GAME_NAME@`, 2D template).

## Prerequisites

- CMake 3.25+ and a C++17 compiler (GCC 11+, Clang 14+, or MSVC 2022).
- Linux dependencies (Ubuntu 24.04):
  ```bash
  sudo apt install -y cmake ninja-build libglm-dev libasound2-dev libpulse-dev libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers glslang-tools
  ```

## Building and Running

Configure and build:

```bash
cmake --preset dev
cmake --build --preset dev
```

Run the game:

```bash
cmake --build --preset dev --target run-@GAME_NAME@
```

Run tests:

```bash
ctest --preset dev
```

For release builds:

```bash
cmake --preset release
cmake --build --preset release
ctest --preset release
```
